      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "Directly serves the exploratory query by giving an aspect-level grouping axis over free-text reviews, letting the analyst see which themes dominate. Categories are well-diversified and non-constant. Groundedness is mostly sound: seat_comfort, food, and staff samples map cleanly to their text. One sample (row 4) is dominated by extensive food description yet labeled 'staff', a defensible but weaker reading, and row 1 mentions many topics with 'staff' being reasonable. Minor mislabeling lowers groundedness slightly but no invented facts."
